	<1294923523.4643.3.camel@m1330u>
Message-ID: <Pine.WNT.4.64.1101131410130.3592@reeve>

Dear Guido,

The latest version on r-forge is revision 129, not 125. But I think 125 
should be mostly OK.

There was a major revision of sienaTimeTest code and the new code 
(125 onwards) will not work with sienaFit objects which were created with 
earlier versions. I suspect your object was created with an earlier 
version as it is missing an attribute used in sienaTimeTest. If you do not 
want to re-run, the following should make sienaTimetest work (although 
there may be other incompatibilities):

attr(twomode.ans$f, "periodNos") <- c(1,2)

I will try to remember to make it clear in the changelog in the manual 
when upgrades will be incompatible with existing objects.

Regards,

Ruth
